# Interleukin-17A-Responsive Systemic Juvenile Idiopathic Arthritis-like Disease in a Patient Carrying a Novel Heterozygous STAT5B Loss-of-Function Variant

This repository contains the R scripts used for the analyses and figure generation in the accompanying manuscript.

## Files

- `preprocess.R`: Data preprocessing
- `utils.R`: Utility functions
- `Figure3.R`: Analysis and visualization for Figure 3

## Data availability

The analysis code is available in this repository. Access to the underlying data is described in the Data Availability Statement of the manuscript.

## Citation

Please cite the accompanying manuscript when using this code.

